<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>For people lazy to move they fingers on keyboard like me :D</Major>
    <Description>Its a basic attack only. im using it for doing quest that need collect items with very very small chance drop. so i can play game on my smartphone while my tamers do their quest. even im using this method to level up my 4 holy beast from level 80 to 100 in waterfront. no need to use any food for restoring your DS. 

How to use :
Just use your strongest digimon put attack skill on slot key 1 (it is by default setting if you not changed it before)
place your tamer in the mid group of spawned place. 

additional: set your distance in interface setting to level 5. use your exp amplification booster and grace exp. better when in burn exp state. in 2 hour you get your 80 - 100 digi level while you do other.

#for macro preventor it is impossible for this because its only keboard recording#</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
